cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Axiomize: Reproducible scientific modeling engine and agent skill pack"
abstract: >-
  Axiomize turns an idea into an explicit, versioned mathematical model with mandatory
  units, validates it dimensionally and numerically, and exports a portable artifact
  that another person can re-run. It ships a Python library, a CLI, REST and MCP
  servers, and an agent skill pack, all backed by the same Model IR and validation
  contract.
authors:
